      "id": 1,
      "text": "Ponca lies within the untamed beauty of the upper Buffalo National River, where towering bluffs and pristine waters create one of America's true wild places.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        3
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
